--- veraflow 2
{"title": "Quick snippets"}
---
{{#action timestamp "Copy timestamp"}}
{{! Format the time at the moment this button is clicked. }}
{{@date "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S %z" local}}
{{/action}}

{{#action greeting "Copy greeting"}}
Hi {{@selection-or-clipboard}}
{{/action}}

{{#action acknowledgement "Copy acknowledgement"}}
Thanks for the update. I'll review it and get back to you.
{{/action}}
